      ** WORKERS' COMP Name Mismatch in Claim Master vs Claim Demographics
      *****************************************************************
      ****              I M P O R T A N T    N O T E               ****
      ****                                                         ****
      ****  This file is cleared before each execution of the      ****
      ****  process to report/update Mismatched records in Claim   ****
      ****  Master compared to Claim Demo. This file will contain  ****
      ****  both Names from WMCDP & WMCMP before update.           ****
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      *  SPECIAL FILE NOTES:                                          *
      *                                                               *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
      * REVISIONS:                                                    *
      *                                                               *
      * 06/01/14  C:242  Support: 85306 WA099 - Original              *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PC201                     TEXT('WMCMP Name Mismatch file')
     A            C2DSS#    R               REFFLD(SS#)
     A            C2DLSN    R               REFFLD(LSN)
     A                                      COLHDG('DMG Last-Name')
     A            C2DFSN    R               REFFLD(FSN)
     A                                      COLHDG('DMG First-Name')
     A            C2DMID    R               REFFLD(MID)
     A                                      COLHDG('DMG Mid-Init')
     A            C2CO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            C2FND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            C2FYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            C2EMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            C2DIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            C2CASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            C2MLSN    R               REFFLD(LSN)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM Last-Name')
     A            C2MFSN    R               REFFLD(FSN)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM First-Name')
     A            C2MMID    R               REFFLD(MID)
     A                                      COLHDG('CLM Mid-Init')
     A            C2STS         10          COLHDG('Process Status')
     A            C2DATE          L         COLHDG('Process Date')
     A            C2TIME          T         COLHDG('Process Time')
